    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: World of Warcraft Campaign, Human Species)</em></p><p>As a descendant of the humans of Arathor and the high elves of Quel’Thalas, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Fey Ancestry.</strong> You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Charmed condition.</p><p><strong>Lethargy Resilience.</strong> When you fail a saving throw to avoid or end the Unconscious condition, you can succeed instead. Once you use this benefit, you can’t do so again until you finish 1d4 Long Rests.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-tVxSYRbQV8ADfmM9\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll the saves against the Charmed condition with Advantage yourself. After <em>Lethargy Resilience</em>, roll 1d4 and give the use back once you have finished that many Long Rests.</p></section>",
